A '''Beeheemoth''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found around the [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
'''Beeheemoth''' spawns every {{Green|~8-13}} minutes at one of several zones in the [[Torrhus Canyon]], those being: the '''Mega Tree''' near {{NPCSprite|Treehugger Timothy}}, {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}, and {{Zone|Critter Safari Entrance}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Beeheemoths''' fly around [[Torrhus Canyon]]. If the player throws a [[Lasso]] at a '''Beeheemoth''', it latches onto the '''Beeheemoth''' and depletes its stamina. Upon running out of stamina, the '''Beeheemoth''' is defeated and drops loot.

